  "mappingNotes": [
    "Organized by syllabus subjects, not simply ZIP folder labels. Diabetes moved from the Week 5 archive folder to Week 3; labor pain management from Week 7 to Week 5; newborn assessment material from Weeks 1/7 to Week 9; infant nutrition from Week 10 to Week 9; contraception/STIs from Week 10 to the August 4 session. Postpartum duplicates filed under Week 9 remain associated with Week 7.",
    "Original titles/course numbers and page contents are preserved, including covers that say NRBS 3510. Course grouping and reader labels identify OB material without altering the source PDFs.",
    "Historical context, fetal development, normal labor/birth and labor pain management remain in weekly materials without being labeled as specific blueprint focuses.",
    "Newborn complications/prematurity links are selected supporting pages in the supplied newborn materials. No dedicated high-risk-newborn lecture PDF is claimed.",
    "No clinical note synthesis, practice-question extraction, new answers or treatment recommendations were added during this presentation import."
  ],
